      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 347,
      "raw": "$$p(x) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2 \\pi \\sigma^2}} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{1}{2 \\sigma^2} (x - \\mu)^2\\right).$$",
      "math": {
