      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 393,
      "raw": "$$P(y \\mid \\mathbf{x}) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2 \\pi \\sigma^2}} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{1}{2 \\sigma^2} (y - \\mathbf{w}^\\top \\mathbf{x} - b)^2\\right).$$",
